abstract: >-
  NiceTryGPT is a minimal-diff workflow for reducing cheap LLM shortcuts in
  existing, authorized Capture the Flag challenges while preserving the
  vulnerability class, learning objective, prerequisite knowledge, and a
  bounded human difficulty cost.
